@host = http://localhost:8100

### Tool catalog
GET {{host}}/api/mcp-ops/tools

### Read-only health tool
POST {{host}}/api/mcp-ops/tools/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actionId": "service_health",
  "params": {"service": "checkout"},
  "confirmed": false
}

### Rollback is gated
POST {{host}}/api/mcp-ops/tools/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actionId": "deployment_rollback",
  "params": {"service": "checkout", "targetVersion": "2026.06.28"},
  "confirmed": false
}

### Confirm rollback
POST {{host}}/api/mcp-ops/tools/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actionId": "deployment_rollback",
  "params": {"service": "checkout", "targetVersion": "2026.06.28"},
  "confirmed": true
}

### Unknown tool failure
POST {{host}}/api/mcp-ops/tools/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actionId": "unknown_tool",
  "params": {},
  "confirmed": true
}
